        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sondine looks for your Mac on your Wi-Fi, and talks to it alone. Tap Allow when iOS asks."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sondine cherche votre Mac sur votre Wi-Fi et ne parle qu’à lui. Touchez Autoriser quand iOS le demande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sondine records when you ask": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sondine records when you ask"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sondine enregistre quand vous le demandez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once paired, Sondine talks only to your own Mac, over your Wi-Fi, or through Tailscale if you allow it on the Mac: your recordings, their names, tags, notes and deletions, and what you search. The Mac may have them transcribed by a server you chose there. In a TestFlight beta, Apple tells the developer about sessions and crashes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once paired, Sondine talks only to your own Mac, over your Wi-Fi, or through Tailscale if you allow it on the Mac: your recordings, their names, tags, notes and deletions, and what you search. The Mac may have them transcribed by a server you chose there. In a TestFlight beta, Apple tells the developer about sessions and crashes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fois appairé, Sondine ne parle qu’à votre propre Mac, par votre Wi-Fi, ou par Tailscale si vous l’autorisez sur le Mac : vos enregistrements, leurs noms, tags, notes et suppressions, et ce que vous cherchez. Le Mac peut les faire transcrire par un serveur que vous y avez choisi. En bêta TestFlight, Apple informe le développeur des sessions et des plantages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts or stops a recording. If iOS does not let it start from the Lock Screen, Sondine opens to start it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts or stops a recording. If iOS does not let it start from the Lock Screen, Sondine opens to start it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lance ou arrête un enregistrement. Si iOS ne le laisse pas démarrer depuis l’écran verrouillé, Sondine s’ouvre pour le lancer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
